:"本人清点确认（演示）","eventId":"e1","note":"工作证、备用电源与充电线。"}],"saved_at":"2026-10-22T21:26:43.011Z"},"accounts":[{"id":"demo-a","username":"a","display_name":"明星 a","role":"artist","enabled":1,"must_change":false},{"id":"demo-b","username":"b","display_name":"团队管理员 b","role":"admin","enabled":1,"must_change":false},{"id":"demo-c","username":"c","display_name":"团队成员 c","role":"member","enabled":1,"must_change":false}],"grants":[{"user_id":"demo-b","project_id":"p1","scopes":["read","plan","execute","location","travel","lodging","contacts","finance"]},{"user_id":"demo-b","project_id":"p2","scopes":["read","plan","execute","location","travel","lodging","contacts","finance"]},{"user_id":"demo-b","project_id":"p3","scopes":["read","plan","execute","location","travel","lodging","contacts","finance"]},{"user_id":"demo-b","project_id":"p4","scopes":["read","plan","execute","location","travel","lodging","contacts","finance"]},{"user_id":"demo-c","project_id":"p1","scopes":["read","plan","execute","location","travel","contacts"]}],"evidence":[],"audit_events":[],"keys":[],"passwords":{},"scripts":[{"id":"demo-script","title":"临行前 · 人物关系示例","sourceName":"内置虚构剧本","text":"人物：林夏、周宁、陈姐、许老师、阿澈\n\n第一场 · 排练室门口 · 夜\n林夏：（收好剧本）明天我会回来。今天，让我自己走出去。\n周宁：我会等你。但你不用为了我改变决定。\n林夏：谢谢。等我回来，我们再把话说清楚。\n\n第二场 · 工作室 · 日\n陈姐：下午有采访，你想先聊作品，还是聊这次训练？\n林夏：先聊角色吧，有些关于自己的事，我还想再想一想。\n陈姐：好，公开的边界我们一起确认。\n\n第三场 · 舞蹈教室 · 傍晚\n许老师：这一段先别着急做动作，听一听音乐停下来的地方。\n林夏：我想把等待，演成一种主动的选择。\n许老师：那就试着从呼吸开始。\n\n第四场 · 剧场大厅 · 夜\n阿澈：林夏，周宁，你们准备好下一场了吗？\n周宁：我准备好了。林夏，你呢？\n林夏：这一次，我想先听见对方，再开口。\n阿澈：好，我们从灯亮之前开始。\n","characters":[{"id":"p-2df5a0911fc0","name":"林夏","dialogueCount":5,"sceneIds":["scene-1","scene-2","scene-3","scene-4"],"firstLine":4},{"id":"p-d3baee63177e","name":"周宁","dialogueCount":2,"sceneIds":["scene-1","scene-4"],"firstLine":5},{"id":"p-435db8bffc07","name":"陈姐","dialogueCount":2,"sceneIds":["scene-2"],"firstLine":9},{"id":"p-9a1f6fb76ea0","name":"许老师","dialogueCount":2,"sceneIds":["scene-3"],"firstLine":14},{"id":"p-87c1787a803e","na